This license applies to the SQuAD 1.1 subset in this repository and to every
reproduction of its questions, answers, or passages, including:

- data/items.json
- data/disputed.json
- data/DATASOURCE.md
- questions, answers, and passages copied under docs/data/ and results/

Copyright in the passages belongs to their Wikipedia authors. The questions
and answers come from SQuAD 1.1 (Rajpurkar, Zhang, Lopyrev, and Liang, 2016;
https://rajpurkar.github.io/SQuAD-explorer/dataset/dev-v1.1.json). The
adaptation is by Leo Helfferich, 2026. Citation and the regenerate command
are in data/DATASOURCE.md.

Changes in this adaptation:

- A 50-question subset of the SQuAD 1.1 development set, passages of 480–1400
  characters.
- For each item, a subtle_error answer: a deterministic numeric edit, or a
  multi-word proper name swapped for another name in the same passage.
- For each item, an unsupported passage: a paragraph from a different article
  that does not contain the gold answer or its salient numbers.
- One planted variant noted in data/disputed.json, because the entity swap
  was not actually wrong.

Share an adaptation under CC BY-SA 4.0, keep this attribution, and say what
you changed.

